// @vibe/compiler/entry/compiler/file_compile — the single-file (fs-rooted,
// no external module closure) compile drivers: every `compile_file_fs_*`
// mode variant (mvp/rc/coverage/trace/break/profiled) plus their cached
// twins threaded through a TypeDb (ADR-0070 Phase 3, #897, compiler-internal
// batch). Compiled into the compiler itself via compiler_sources_manifest.tsv
// (group `entry`, dual-row: this contract + file_compile.vibe).
